<title>USA: Riverhead, N.Y., $1.729 mln won by Roosevelt.</title>
<headline>Riverhead, N.Y., $1.729 mln won by Roosevelt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross, Inc., said it won $1.729 million of Riverhead, N.Y., public improvement bonds, 1996, Series A, with a net interest cost of 5.0558 percent.</p>
</text>
